WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.340
Anyone who sits in the armchair and answers a couple of questions can choose one of the valuable prizes.

2
00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.160
What is comfort for you?

3
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.220
When I sit down and drink my coffee.

4
00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:13.480
Which person gives you the feeling of home?

5
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.020
Family. My whole family. My children.

6
00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:18.800
Wherever I am with them, I feel as if I am at home.

7
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:22.180
How long can you spend in pyjamas without feeling guilty?

8
00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:23.720
Could you stay in pyjamas the whole day?

9
00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:29.140
Yes. The world would be a more comfortable place if people could be in pyjamas all day.

10
00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:33.340
Do you think the world needs more comfort and why?

11
00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:36.340
Of course. We need more love, more attention.

12
00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:43.140
We need more comfort so that we can be relaxed.

13
00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:45.640
We have a little gift for you, you can choose.

14
00:00:47.140 --> 00:00:49.940
A gift card, Extreme Intimo.

15
00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:51.940
Three thousand dinars.

16
00:00:55.140 --> 00:00:57.440
Pyjamas. Pyjamas. Extreme Intimo.

17
00:00:57.440 --> 00:01:03.880
It seems comfort means something different to everyone, but one thing is certain: the world needs more comfort.
